Z||000004||K2m4||12-11-2001||11:21 AM||||disconnect the other tv thats on that cable line see if that works. you may have a week enough signal that when you split the line the tuner isnt getting any RF. you may need a cable RF booster if thats the case. <P>------------------<BR>Kerm<BR>86 GT<BR>86 2M4||||reg||1
Z||000005||BC-GT||12-11-2001||09:23 PM||||Thanks <B>K2m4</B> but half the tuner still works so I don't think that's the problem, BTW I did take the other TV off and feed the line directly into this one, no dice. Anyway, I called the repair guy and he said the tuner is split into low/mid/high frequencies and that this type of thing is fairly common, should be here any time to pick it up.<BR>||||reg||1
